<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Formas de Pagamento - <%= barbearia.nome %></title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'class' };
        if (localStorage.getItem('theme') === 'dark') document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
    </script>
    <style>
        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .animate-slide-up { animation: slideUp 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors duration-300">

    <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>

    <main class="p-4 md:p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full animate-slide-up">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-8 gap-4">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-blue-600">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wallet"></i>
                    </div>
                    Formas de Pagamento
                </h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1 ml-14">Configure os métodos de cobrança na sua vitrine online e presencial.</p>
            </div>
            
            <button type="submit" form="formPagamentos" class="w-full md:w-auto bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-md transition-transform hover:scale-105 flex justify-center items-center">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check mr-2"></i> Salvar Configurações
            </button>
        </div>

        <form id="formPagamentos" action="/barbearia-app/admin/pagamentos/salvar" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
            
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-black mb-6 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 pb-3 text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shop text-blue-500 mr-2"></i> Pagamento Presencial (No Local)
                </h3>
                
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/50">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-inner transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-money-bill-wave"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-black text-gray-800 dark:text-white text-lg">Dinheiro ou PIX direto</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Cliente acerta os valores diretamente no balcão da barbearia.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer ml-4">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="dinheiro" class="sr-only peer" <%= pagamentos.dinheiro ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                            <div class="w-14 h-7 bg-gray-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer dark:bg-gray-700 peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-gray-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-6 after:w-6 after:transition-all dark:border-gray-500 peer-checked:bg-blue-600 shadow-inner"></div>
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/50">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/30 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-inner transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
                                <i class="fa-regular fa-credit-card"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-black text-gray-800 dark:text-white text-lg">Cartão de Crédito</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Uso da maquininha física do salão.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer ml-4">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="credito" class="sr-only peer" <%= pagamentos.credito ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                            <div class="w-14 h-7 bg-gray-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer dark:bg-gray-700 peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-gray-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-6 after:w-6 after:transition-all dark:border-gray-500 peer-checked:bg-indigo-600 shadow-inner"></div>
                        </label>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/50">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xl shadow-inner transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-black text-gray-800 dark:text-white text-lg">Cartão de Débito</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Uso da maquininha física do salão.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <label class="relative inline-flex items-center cursor-pointer ml-4">
                            <input type="checkbox" name="debito" class="sr-only peer" <%= pagamentos.debito ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                            <div class="w-14 h-7 bg-gray-300 peer-focus:outline-none rounded-full peer dark:bg-gray-700 peer-checked:after:translate-x-full peer-checked:after:border-white after:content-[''] after:absolute after:top-[2px] after:left-[2px] after:bg-white after:border-gray-300 after:border after:rounded-full after:h-6 after:w-6 after:transition-all dark:border-gray-500 peer-checked:bg-blue-500 shadow-inner"></div>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-6 border-b border-blue-200 dark:border-gray-700 pb-4 gap-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up mr-2"></i> Integração Mercado Pago
                    </h3>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-black tracking-widest rounded-lg uppercase shadow-sm">
                        Gateway Online
                    </span>
                </div>
                
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 font-medium bg-white/50 dark:bg-gray-900/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white dark:border-gray-700">
                    Ao preencher estas chaves, o seu sistema passa a aceitar pagamentos via <strong>PIX Automático</strong> e <strong>Cartões de Crédito</strong> diretamente na página de agendamento do cliente (Checkout Bricks).
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 tracking-wider mb-2">Public Key <span class="text-gray-400 normal-case">(Chave Pública)</span></label>
                        <input type="text" name="mp_public_key" value="<%= pagamentos.mp_public_key || '' %>" placeholder="APP_USR-..." class="w-full p-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none font-mono text-sm shadow-sm transition-all">
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 tracking-wider mb-2">Access Token <span class="text-gray-400 normal-case">(Token Privado)</span></label>
                        <input type="password" name="mp_access_token" value="<%= pagamentos.mp_access_token || '' %>" placeholder="APP_USR-..." class="w-full p-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none font-mono text-sm shadow-sm transition-all">
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end">
                    <a href="https://www.mercadopago.com.br/developers/panel/credentials" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors flex items-center">
                        Onde encontro minhas credenciais? <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square ml-1"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </form>
    </main>
<script src="/barbearia-app/public/js/theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>